("29494091", "expert", 3, "Tetanus is classified into 4 categories: Generalized. Localized. Cephalic. Neonatal",
 ("Which is NOT one of the four clinical forms of tetanus?", ["Generalized", "Cephalic", "Neonatal", "Pulmonary"],
  "Tetanus is classified as generalized, localized, cephalic or neonatal.", "Pulmonary isn't a form."),
 ("¿Cuál NO es una de las cuatro formas clínicas del tétanos?", ["Generalizado", "Cefálico", "Neonatal", "Pulmonar"],
  "El tétanos se clasifica en generalizado, localizado, cefálico y neonatal.", "No existe la forma pulmonar.")),

